[keafile]

_START_
name: "KeamsOS KeaFile",
version: "0.1",

_UPDATE_

About: "KeaFile is a configuration file format for KeamsOS. It is designed to be simple, human-readable, and easy to parse. The format supports various data types, including strings, numbers, lists, and nested sections. KeaFiles can be used to configure applications, define settings, and store structured data."

_END_